WEBVTT

00:00:18.238 --> 00:00:21.460
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I’m tired. What time is it?

00:00:28.171 --> 00:00:30.952
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> It’s eleven o’clock.

00:00:37.914 --> 00:00:39.505
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I need to go.

00:00:45.335 --> 00:00:47.574
I have a meeting in Oxford tomorrow morning.

00:00:54.548 --> 00:00:55.600
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> One more drink?

00:01:02.496 --> 00:01:03.680
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Oh, OK!

00:01:25.087 --> 00:01:27.726
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Excuse me. What time is it?

00:01:34.742 --> 00:01:36.997
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> It’s a quarter to eight.

00:01:43.855 --> 00:01:45.028
What time’s your train?

00:01:50.849 --> 00:01:52.915
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> At seven forty-seven.

00:01:58.755 --> 00:02:01.854
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> You need to hurry! You only have two minutes.

00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:08.228
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Thanks.

00:02:55.768 --> 00:02:57.901
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Hello. I’m Rob Walker.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.489
I’m sorry I’m late.

00:03:12.851 --> 00:03:16.234
<v><b>Man:</b></v> You’re an hour late. It’s half past ten.

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:24.689
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I know. I’m really sorry.